        "/api/v1/auth/token": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Exchange an authorization code for an ID token and an access token",
                "description": "Exchange an authorization code for an ID token and an access token\n\nThe client authenticates with `client_secret_basic` or `client_secret_post`\n(RFC 6749 §2.3.1). Errors are RFC 6749 §5.2 error objects. Every response carries\n`Cache-Control: no-store` and `Pragma: no-cache` (RFC 6749 §5.1).\n\nA code is redeemed once. RFC 6749 §4.1.2: \"The client MUST NOT use the authorization\ncode more than once. If an authorization code is used more than once, the\nauthorization server MUST deny the request\". A row lock serializes concurrent\nredemptions.\n\nThe `redirect_uri` has to equal the one of the authorization request exactly, compared\nas a string like the authorization endpoint does.\n\nRFC 9700 §2.1.1: \"a token request containing a code_verifier parameter is accepted\nonly if a code_challenge parameter was present in the authorization request\"",
                "operationId": "get_token",
                "requestBody": {
                    "content": {
                        "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenRequest"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "500": {
                        "description": "",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApiErrorResponse"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
